/** @page about About
  @section doc lds-cpp Documentation

  This library provides low-discrepancy sequence (LDS) generators for quasi-Monte Carlo methods.

  The fundamental building block is the van der Corput sequence in base \f$b\f$:
  @f[
      \phi_b(n) = \sum_{k=0}^{\infty} a_k(n) \, b^{-k-1}
  @f]
  where \f$a_k(n)\f$ are the base-\f$b\f$ digits of \f$n\f$.

  See the \ref lds "lds" namespace for the full API.
*/
